 ## Overview
-Midpoint Displacement Fractal generates a 2D noise grid using recursive midpoint displacement to create a fractal terrain or noise map [S2, unofficial]. It differs from its parent, Random Heightmap Terrain Generation, by imposing spatial correlation through recursive averaging and roughening, rather than assigning independent random heights to all vertices [S2, unofficial].
